{"2881170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "My fair damnation", "steam_appid": 2881170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/a774b28e1697a6a3b2a3c0dd1cb9df2b.poster.avif?t=1765213602\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/a774b28e1697a6a3b2a3c0dd1cb9df2b.webm?t=1765213602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/a774b28e1697a6a3b2a3c0dd1cb9df2b.mp4?t=1765213602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is this place?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up with a gasp of rotten air in a hospital your mind refuses to remember.<br>The dark, windowless corridors close in on you with claws of guilt.<br>Day is darkness. Night is oblivion.<br>But you are not alone…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/57070588b79a04894572ad719b0968a4.poster.avif?t=1765213602\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/57070588b79a04894572ad719b0968a4.webm?t=1765213602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/57070588b79a04894572ad719b0968a4.mp4?t=1765213602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet your patients</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nurse must care for her patients. Watch over them. Never harm those who need help… right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tend to the grotesque residents of this cursed asylum.<br>Talk to them, earn their trust — you share this prison of tiles and shadow.<br>You’d better make sure they’re pleased with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/df9aca10a96270aa6bdb07a8887ac51f.poster.avif?t=1765213602\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/df9aca10a96270aa6bdb07a8887ac51f.webm?t=1765213602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/df9aca10a96270aa6bdb07a8887ac51f.mp4?t=1765213602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the tragedy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lust, murder, betrayal.<br>To sin against the light has cast you into the foulest darkness.<br>Discover your connection to the other inmates, and the reason for your punishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/361f404cc43a1e7fac0b399366de670a.poster.avif?t=1765213602\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/361f404cc43a1e7fac0b399366de670a.webm?t=1765213602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/361f404cc43a1e7fac0b399366de670a.mp4?t=1765213602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the darkness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not an escape.<br>Your fragile mind is breaking apart — especially when you meet <strong>him</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure your private hell as you search for a way out.<br>Time runs fast, and your breath runs thin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Fair Damnation</strong> is a <strong>first-person psychological horror</strong> about guilt, faith, and redemption.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>What light could ever shine bright enough to guide us through the valley of death?</i></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/a774b28e1697a6a3b2a3c0dd1cb9df2b.poster.avif?t=1765213602\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/a774b28e1697a6a3b2a3c0dd1cb9df2b.webm?t=1765213602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/a774b28e1697a6a3b2a3c0dd1cb9df2b.mp4?t=1765213602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is this place?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up with a gasp of rotten air in a hospital your mind refuses to remember.<br>The dark, windowless corridors close in on you with claws of guilt.<br>Day is darkness. Night is oblivion.<br>But you are not alone…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/57070588b79a04894572ad719b0968a4.poster.avif?t=1765213602\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/57070588b79a04894572ad719b0968a4.webm?t=1765213602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/57070588b79a04894572ad719b0968a4.mp4?t=1765213602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet your patients</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nurse must care for her patients. Watch over them. Never harm those who need help… right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tend to the grotesque residents of this cursed asylum.<br>Talk to them, earn their trust — you share this prison of tiles and shadow.<br>You’d better make sure they’re pleased with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/df9aca10a96270aa6bdb07a8887ac51f.poster.avif?t=1765213602\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/df9aca10a96270aa6bdb07a8887ac51f.webm?t=1765213602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/df9aca10a96270aa6bdb07a8887ac51f.mp4?t=1765213602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the tragedy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lust, murder, betrayal.<br>To sin against the light has cast you into the foulest darkness.<br>Discover your connection to the other inmates, and the reason for your punishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/361f404cc43a1e7fac0b399366de670a.poster.avif?t=1765213602\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/361f404cc43a1e7fac0b399366de670a.webm?t=1765213602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/extras/361f404cc43a1e7fac0b399366de670a.mp4?t=1765213602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the darkness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not an escape.<br>Your fragile mind is breaking apart — especially when you meet <strong>him</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure your private hell as you search for a way out.<br>Time runs fast, and your breath runs thin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Fair Damnation</strong> is a <strong>first-person psychological horror</strong> about guilt, faith, and redemption.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>What light could ever shine bright enough to guide us through the valley of death?</i></h2>", "short_description": "You are a nurse trapped in a decaying hospital, surrounded by grotesque patients you must care for… for your own sake. Step into this psychological horror, uncover the reason for your punishment, and survive the darkness born from within yourself. But above all… stay away from him.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/0a5a85c466e9068a14dbad0d665ba8375688187c/header.jpg?t=1765213602", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/267ecbfbb1f4f640f35941c3132655ed173adf73/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765213602", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881170/267ecbfbb1f4f640f35941c3132655ed173adf73/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765213602", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 Monterey or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.6 GHz Dual-Core (Intel) or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 6000 / Apple M1 Integrated GPU<br><